From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vlad Lavrishko <lavrishkovlad@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 21:44:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] unlock: bypass forward/save restrictions and reveal
 view-once media
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- forbidsForward() and forbidsSaving() always return false — removes
  per-message NoForwards flag enforcement
- hasCopyRestriction() in HistoryInner always returns false — bypasses
  per-peer allowsForwarding() block on text copy
- CopyRestrictionTypeFor() always returns None — same bypass for list
  widget context menus
- hasCopyMediaRestriction() in media viewer returns false for non-story
  — enables download from restricted chats in the overlay
- Gif::draw: view-once (TTL) round video notes no longer hidden; the
  revealed value no longer collapses to 0 for TTL media outside the
  TTL viewer layer

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Telegram/SourceFiles/history/history_inner_widget.cpp     | 2 +-
 Telegram/SourceFiles/history/history_item.cpp             | 7 +------
 .../SourceFiles/history/view/history_view_list_widget.cpp | 8 +-------
 .../SourceFiles/history/view/media/history_view_gif.cpp   | 6 +-----
 .../SourceFiles/media/view/media_view_overlay_widget.cpp  | 3 +--
 5 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

